# Phase 0 data policy
# Local corpora, parsed artifacts, indexes, outlines, and run outputs stay out
# of git. Only tiny curated samples under data/samples/ may be source-controlled.
data/database/
data/outlines/
data/papers/
data/processed_papers/
data/review_outputs/
data/eval_outputs/
!data/README.md
!data/.gitkeep
!data/samples/
!data/samples/.gitkeep

